# image 1
Style: Chinese Ink Wash (Sumi-e)
Aspect Ratio: 16:9
Chinese ink wash painting, sumi-e style. Terraced tea garden on a hillside in late autumn, rows of tea bushes curving across the slope. A woven bamboo picking basket rests on the edge of one terrace, half filled with mature tea leaves. Thin mist in the valley below, low golden afternoon light from the right. Muted ochre, russet and sage ink tones, wet brush strokes on rice paper, generous negative space, calm and contemplative. No text, no lettering.
